<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:50:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Swoon as AI Fears Spur Rush to Treasuries: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</link><description>随着投资者开始认真思考仍然笼罩在这家全球最大芯片制造商身上的问题，英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋周一回归后，围绕该公司股价的乐观情绪正在消退。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value'&gt;Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia Still Faces Issues That Cost $2 Trillion in Market Value&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:20:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>丹格特炼油厂据称将于 12 月 1 日在拉各斯上市</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/dangote-refinery-said-to-list-in-lagos-on-december-1-video</link><description>彭博社了解到，亿万富翁阿利科·丹格特的炼油厂最快将于下周在拉各斯开始交易。 Dangote Petroleum Refinery &amp; Petrochemicals 定于 12 月 1 日首次公开募股，这将是非洲最大的 IPO。首席非洲记者 Jennifer Zabasajja 从约翰内斯堡报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/dangote-refinery-said-to-list-in-lagos-on-december-1-video'&gt;丹格特炼油厂据称将于 12 月 1 日在拉各斯上市&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dangote Refinery Said to List in Lagos on December 1&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/dangote-refinery-said-to-list-in-lagos-on-december-1-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:53:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bullrich 骰子可以重新选举 Milei 的经济状况</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-dice-que-reeleccion-de-milei-esta-en-riesgo-si-la-economia-no-mejora</link><description>帕特丽夏·布尔里奇 (Patricia Bullrich) 表示，2028 年的经济发展前景将更加光明：2027 年的选举将在 2027 年到来。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-dice-que-reeleccion-de-milei-esta-en-riesgo-si-la-economia-no-mejora'&gt;Bullrich 骰子可以重新选举 Milei 的经济状况&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bullrich dice que reelección de Milei está en riesgo si la economía no mejora&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-dice-que-reeleccion-de-milei-esta-en-riesgo-si-la-economia-no-mejora</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:45:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>迪尔预计 2027 年农民将面临阻力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/deere-sees-headwinds-ahead-for-farmers-in-2027-video</link><description>迪尔公司表示，预计截至 10 月份的 12 个月内，其最大机器的销量将会增加，但净利润也将达到 45 亿至 52.5 亿美元，低于彭博社编制的分析师平均预期 61 亿美元。克里斯·西奥利诺 (Chris Ciolino) 有关“彭博未平仓合约”的更多内容。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/deere-sees-headwinds-ahead-for-farmers-in-2027-video'&gt;迪尔预计 2027 年农民将面临阻力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Deere Sees Headwinds Ahead for Farmers in 2027&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/deere-sees-headwinds-ahead-for-farmers-in-2027-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:46:13 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>